### 2.8.5 Change Password with a 147-character New Password (Expect 400 Bad Request)
### The password policy caps passwords at 128 characters (PasswordRules). Before the cap this
### returned 200 and left the account on the long password, breaking every later suite's login.
# @name changePasswordExtremelyLong
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/me/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantManagerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "currentPassword": "{{tenantManagerPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "VeryLongPassword123VeryLongPassword123VeryLongPassword123VeryLongPassword123VeryLongPassword123VeryLongPassword123VeryLongPassword123VeryLongPassword123@"
}

?? status == 400

### 2.8.6 Login Attempt Multiple Times Rapidly (Rate Limiting Test) - Expect 429 Too Many Requests after threshold
# @name loginRateLimitTest1
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "email": "{{superAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "WrongPassword1"
}

